Stomata Orbit sounds like a hyper-caffeinated 1965 Blue Note hard bop quintet hurled into geostationary orbit through an underwater tape delay: furious acoustic trumpet arpeggios and walking upright bass collide against woozy, pitch-bent vapor pads, cosmic modular chirps, and room-shaking physical handclaps drenched in cathedral reverberation.

